This directory is populated with the built frontend (frontend/dist) at Docker
build time — see the root Dockerfile's `COPY --from=frontend-builder ... dist`.

The committed placeholder only ensures `//go:embed all:dist` has a file to embed
for local/API-only builds. When no index.html is embedded, the server runs
API-only and the SPA is served elsewhere (Vite dev server, or a build that
embeds the real dist).
